ShroudForge includes five mod packages in the current repository. Each package is a separate mod with its own ID, manifest, settings, activation state, process targets, and installation notes. Open a mod article to read its full behavior and limits. This catalogue gives a quick overview and links to those independent pages.

Mod settings belong to the individual package. They are separate from general ShroudForge Modloader preferences. A package may require a game restart for startup asset changes, while another may apply settings while the game is running. Check the article and the Modloader status before enabling a feature.

