== Choose the right package ==

* For recipe ingredient costs, supported item consumption, or production durations, read [[Mod: Crafting Essentials]]. Its settings have different activation times. Recipe cost changes require startup preparation and a restart. Supported item use and original-time scaling can be live.
* For survival options, read [[Mod: Survival]]. Its effects have different scopes. In particular, weapon durability applies to the entire hosted world, including other players' equipment.
* For flight control, read [[Mod: Unlimited Flight]]. The authoritative host or Dedicated Server must run the mod to control the shared world.
* To change recipe unlock requirements, read [[Mod: Unlock Blueprints]]. It is disabled by default and changing its state requires a restart. Reverting it can require resetting affected blueprint unlock progress.
* For building capture and placement, read [[Mod: World Editor]]. Install it in the client and the Dedicated Server when using server-side editing. Review the preview and recovery notes before placing a blueprint.

