== Package status and compatibility ==

The current package list is taken from the direct mod folders in the repository. Package presence does not guarantee compatibility with every Enshrouded build. Check each mod's article, the latest ShroudForge release notes, and the package status shown by the Modloader before use.

The <code>Mods</code> category contains one article per current or historically documented mod. This overview is a starting point. The individual mod pages are the detailed references.

